    "issue": "Automatic public IP assignment enabled",
    "risk": "Instances launched in the subnet automatically receive public IPs, increasing internet exposure and attack surface.",
    "remediation": "Set `map_public_ip_on_launch = false` on `aws_subnet.web_subnet` and place internet-facing resources behind controlled entry points such as a load balancer or bastion architecture."
