    "risk": "VPC Flow Logs stored in the bucket may be readable if underlying storage access is compromised or if organizational encryption requirements are not met, increasing the risk of log data exposure.",
    "remediation": "Add server-side encryption configuration to the bucket using an `aws_s3_bucket_server_side_encryption_configuration` resource for `aws_s3_bucket.flowbucket`, setting SSE-S3 or SSE-KMS as the default."
