    "risk": "Accidental or malicious deletion/overwrite of log objects cannot be recovered easily, reducing integrity and availability of audit logs.",
    "remediation": "Enable versioning by adding an `aws_s3_bucket_versioning` resource for `aws_s3_bucket.flowbucket` with `versioning_configuration { status = \"Enabled\" }`."
