    "risk": "The bucket and all contained flow logs can be deleted during Terraform destroy or misconfiguration, causing loss of audit evidence and weakening forensic capabilities.",
    "remediation": "Set `force_destroy = false` on `aws_s3_bucket.flowbucket` to prevent automatic deletion of non-empty log buckets."
  },
  {
    "resource": "aws_s3_bucket.flowbucket",
    "issue": "No public access block configured",
    "risk": "Without an explicit public access block, future bucket policies or ACL changes could accidentally expose sensitive flow logs publicly.",
    "remediation": "Add an `aws_s3_bucket_public_access_block` resource for `aws_s3_bucket.flowbucket` with `block_public_acls = true`, `ignore_public_acls = true`, `block_public_policy = true`, and `restrict_public_buckets = true`."
